Description:You are at 5 life. The opponent's Ancient Brontodon (9/9) is attacking you. You control three Raging Goblins (1/1) and Gray Ogre (2/2), no lands, and have Stoke the Flames (convoke, 4 damage to any target) in hand. End the turn with Ancient Brontodon in the opponent's graveyard and yourself at 5 life.
Rule:authored-tapped-blockers | Tapping a creature that has already been declared as a blocker does not remove it from combat or stop its combat damage (CR 506.4b): block with all four, then convoke Stoke the Flames tapping the blockers; 4 + 5 combat damage kills the 9/9, while casting Stoke before blocks leaves no untapped blocker
